['语言_par_soul_03_4051410']='[EX+10]: [Heaven Kick of Pain] lv3 now also has 40% chance to inflict 1 stack of [DMG Amplify] (2 turns). Targets affected by [DMG Amplify] receives 10% more damage.',
['语言_par_soul_03_4051420']='[EX+20]: In [Summon: Katsuyu] lv3, the Healing factor for the Revived ally+20% (to 220%), and the ally gets a [Barrier - Counter] (2 turns).',
