['语言_ite_1_d_72113']='The Six Paths Sage used this to create the world. Use this to get Sage Tool skin: <div fontcolor=#9e501b>Nunoboko</div>\nAll Sage Tools\' <div fontcolor=#9e501b>HP+6%, ATK+6%</div>\nThis skin is obtained from events. <div fontcolor=#9e501b>Validity: 14 days</div>',
['语言_ite_1_d_72114']='Mahākāla conjures huge black cubes to enemies. Use this to get Sage Tool skin: <div fontcolor=#9e501b>Mahākāla Cubes</div>\nAll Sage Tools\' <div fontcolor=#9e501b>HP+6%, ATK+7%</div>\nThis skin is obtained from events. <div fontcolor=#9e501b>Validity: 14 days</div>',
