['语言_mon_du_04_4']='Ω8722',
['语言_mon_map_01_11']='1. In Summer Party, you may use<div fontcolor=#fca000> Dice </div>or<div fontcolor=#fca000> Jetton </div>to explore. Get<div fontcolor=#fca000> 1 </div>Exploration Pts from each exploration, and unlock the next map for achieving some conditions.\n2. An event is triggered when you move to a grid, and you may get<div fontcolor=#fca000> big rewards </div>from a victory or a correct choice.\n3. Defeat the boss for rich rewards!\n4. You may use the<div fontcolor=#fca000> Ice-cream </div>dropped in Summer Party to trade for items in Summer Shop. Summer Shop will be gone when event is closed,<div fontcolor=#fca000> please use up your Ice-cream in time!</div>\n5. <div fontcolor=#fca000>Exploration Pts and Damage Buff can only be enjoyed by Guild members. </div>No Guild, no Exploration Pts and buffs. Better join a Guild asap!',
['语言_mon_map_01_12']='1. Each map has its independent Exploration Pts, earn enough Exploration Pts to unlock the Party Boss!\n2. <div fontcolor=#fca000>Exploration Pts+1 </div>from each move. You can get items to move from event tasks.\n3. Use<div fontcolor=#fca000> Featured Ninjas </div>to deal massive damage to the boss!\n4. Earn<div fontcolor=#fca000> Challenge Rewards </div>by starting a challenge and<div fontcolor=#fca000> KO Rewards </div>by defeating a boss. All rewards are sent to mailbox. Attention: If you leave your Guild for another one and defeat a boss again, no rewards could be obtained.\n5. Exploration Pts and Buffs are linked to your Guild. Once you leave your Guild, all individual Exploration Pts and Buffs will be emptied.\n6. Ranks of Guilds are different based on maps. Rewards will be calculated and sent to<div fontcolor=#fca000> Guild Warehouse</div>.\n7. When all bosses have been defeated, they will enter [Pursuit Mode], from which you only get dropped rewards. No ranks will be influenced from [Pursuit Mode].',
['语言_mon_map_02_1']='Sandcastle Fight',
['语言_mon_map_02_2']='Eight-Tails Slash',
['语言_mon_map_02_3']='Lost in Forest',
['语言_mon_map_02_4']='Balloon Ride',
['语言_mon_map_07_1']='Hey you, stop there. Tell me why I\'m still single till this summer?',
['语言_mon_map_07_2']='Cuz I\'m not pretty enough or I haven\'t try on those Đồ Bơis thingies?',
['语言_mon_map_07_3']='Hush… I\'m not a perv, it\'s all for my work! I have my book to write, see!',
['语言_mon_map_07_4']='Everybody loves summer! So many picturesque stunners…',
['语言_mon_map_07_5']='Be aware of dangers in your exploration!',
['语言_mon_map_07_6']='First thing first, allow me to heal your wound.',
['语言_mon_map_07_7']='I, I\'m still not ready for this… Do you think I\'m gonna be pretty on this?',
['语言_mon_map_07_8']='Wish I could fit in this Đồ Bơi next year…Will you wait for me until then?',
['语言_mon_map_07_9']='People are talking about the fireworks display tonight, I really want to be there.',
['语言_mon_map_07_10']='Where is sister? You say Killer B\'s concert? Well, I\'m not that intrigued…',
['语言_mon_map_07_11']='It ain\'t easy to have a trip, we\'d better have fun! Could you go with me?',
['语言_mon_map_07_12']='Everyone is enjoy their summertime, I cannot miss this!',
['语言_mon_map_07_13']='If you can\'t do 500 push-up in a row, then do rope skipping 1200 times! If you can\'t do rope skipping 1200 times, then we kick the trunk 2000 times!',
['语言_mon_map_07_14']='Hard-working helps you to surpass a genius!',
['语言_mon_map_07_15']='Everyone, ART IS AN EXPLOSION! I am the host for this fireworks display!',
['语言_mon_map_07_16']='You guys, enjoy the art, don\'t just stare at the fireworks! Life\'s only beautiful because it\'s so fleeting, so transient, right?',
['语言_mon_map_07_17']='Gotta run',
['语言_mon_map_07_18']='Nah',
['语言_mon_map_07_19']='No Đồ Bơi',
['语言_mon_map_07_20']='Stop him',
['语言_mon_map_07_21']='Join him',
['语言_mon_map_07_22']='No means no',
['语言_mon_map_07_23']='Please',
['语言_mon_map_07_24']='I will',
['语言_mon_map_07_25']='Cheer!',
['语言_mon_map_07_26']='Whatever',
['语言_mon_map_07_27']='Let\'s go together',
['语言_mon_map_07_28']='I\'ll do my business',
['语言_mon_map_07_29']='You can do this!',
['语言_mon_map_07_30']='Don\'t you want to see Sakura in Đồ Bơi?',
['语言_mon_map_07_31']='I\'ll have a good enjoy',
['语言_mon_map_07_32']='Whatever',
['语言_mon_map_07_33']='I prefer eternal beauty!',
['语言_mon_map_07_34']='Me',
['语言_mon_map_07_35']='What a weird bottle… gotta keep away from it',
['语言_mon_map_07_36']='It says: write a number down and put it in me. (win big if the grids to move are the same)',
['语言_mon_map_07_37']='I\'m not buying it! (but what if it\'s real…)',
['语言_mon_map_07_38']='The bottle is gone! Could it be that…',
['语言_mon_map_08_1']='Trap',
['语言_mon_map_08_2']='Lucky Balloon',
['语言_mon_map_08_3']='Finger-Guessing',
['语言_mon_map_08_4']='Unknown events',
['语言_mon_map_08_5']='Wealth Rain',
['语言_mon_map_08_6']='Boss',
['语言_mon_map_08_7']='Swim Ring',
['语言_mon_map_08_8']='Coconut',
['语言_mon_map_08_9']='Naruto Spirit',
['语言_mon_map_08_10']='Watergun',
['语言_mon_map_08_11']='Terminus',
['语言_mon_map_08_12']='Wishing Bottle',
['语言_mon_map_08_13']='Watch out, some<div fontcolor=#9e501b> regular minions ambush here</div>, get them for big rewards and<div fontcolor=#9e501b> Challenge Tickets</div>',
['语言_mon_map_08_14']='A really big<div fontcolor=#9e501b> mysterious pack</div>! Move here for big rewards and<div fontcolor=#9e501b> Challenge Tickets</div>',
['语言_mon_map_08_15']='Hey, bet you wanna<div fontcolor=#9e501b> win this finger-guessing</div>! Rewards await!',
['语言_mon_map_08_16']='Naruto got your back! <div fontcolor=#9e501b>Make your choice</div>! Chance to harvest lots of rewards!',
['语言_mon_map_08_17']='<div fontcolor=#9e501b>Lucky, got a Guild Red Packet</div>! A nice guy always shares with his friends!',
['语言_mon_map_08_18']='Alert, Boss is arriving, <div fontcolor=#9e501b>a high-difficulty Boss battle is on the brink</div>! Defeat it for massive rewards and<div fontcolor=#9e501b> Challenge Tickets</div>',
['语言_mon_map_08_19']='Cute duckling swim ring! Trigger it to<div fontcolor=#9e501b> forward the same grids from your last move</div>',
['语言_mon_map_08_20']='All the coolness and pleasure has melt in this juice!\n<div fontcolor=#9e501b>Deals 5 times the damage in your next battle! (excludes a party challenge)</div>',
['语言_mon_map_08_21']='Gee, you are as lucky as Naruto is! \n<div fontcolor=#9e501b> Drop rate+100% from your next move</div>',
['语言_mon_map_08_22']='The must for summer!\n<div fontcolor=#9e501b>Win directly from your next battle (excludes a party challenge)</div>',
['语言_mon_map_08_23']='Make a wish. <div fontcolor=#9e501b>If the grids you move next time = selected grids</div>, you win big rewards',
['语言_mon_map_08_24']='This is not the end, <div fontcolor=#9e501b>but you still can get rich rewards</div>! (get Golds*150, HP Buff*3, ATK Buff*3 and Challenge Ticket*1)',
['语言_mon_map_09_1']='Welcome to Summer Party!',
['语言_mon_map_09_2']='I only tell you this: there are so many treasures here!',
['语言_mon_map_09_3']='By the way, how do you like my Đồ Bơi? Haha, boy, I was kidding. Anyway, enjoy your summer!',
['语言_mon_map_09_4']='This is my confidence work! I think I just built a real Hidden Sand Village.',
['语言_mon_map_09_5']='Oh don\'t get me wrong, it\'s not the outcome of Chakra, it\'s pure sand!',
['语言_mon_map_09_6']='Besides, I put some treasures and traps in the castle…Get happy or get anxious!',
['语言_mon_map_09_7']='Yo, welcome to my land, skr!',
['语言_mon_map_09_8']=' Summer, summer, summertime, time to sit back and unwind  A little bit out of control it\'s cool to dance ',
['语言_mon_map_10_1']='Watergun',
['语言_mon_map_10_2']='Naruto Spirit',
['语言_mon_map_10_3']='Terminus',
['语言_mon_or_01_1']='Summer Commands',
['语言_mon_or_01_2']='Rules: \n1. During the event, explore maps to earn certain number of<div fontcolor=#249003> Ice-cream </div>to get rewards! Unlock Commands to get exclusive rewards!\n2. Login daily to unlock 2 levels of rewards. You will be able to unlock all rewards if log in the last 2 days.',
['语言_mon_or_01_3']='Activate Summer Commands for rich rewards!',
['语言_mon_or_01_4']='Unlock Commands to get',
['语言_mon_or_01_5']='Totally get from Commands',
['语言_mon_or_01_6']='Play event fro massive materials',
['语言_mon_or_01_7']='Sports Commands',
['语言_mon_or_01_8']='Rules: \n1. During the event period, collect certain number of<div fontcolor=#249003> Souvenir Badges </div>by completing event tasks to earn rich rewards!\n2.More exclusive rewards await in Sports Commands!\n3. Unlock Commands to get 5 more challenge chances against Shukaku! Challenge chances cap is raised to 10 now!',
['语言_mon_or_01_9']='Buy Souvenir Badges to upgrade your Commands quickly',
['语言_mon_or_01_10']='Unlock Commands to get',
['语言_mon_or_01_11']='Totally get from Commands',
['语言_mon_or_01_12']='Play event fro massive materials',
['语言_mon_or_02_1']='Get certain number of Ice-cream',
['语言_mon_or_02_2']='Get certain number of Souvenir Badges',															   
['语言_mon_fu_01_1']='Quỹ\nTrung đẳng',
['语言_mon_fu_01_2']='Quỹ\nThượng đẳng',
['语言_mon_fu_01_d_1']='<div fontcolor=#fffbf0 outline=2,#000000>Tổng giá trị</div><img src=\'resource/vật phẩm/3.png\' scale=0.3 /><div fontcolor=#ffd987 outline=2,#000000> 4600 KNB</div><div fontcolor=#fffbf0 outline=2,#000000> Phần thưởng Sang trọng đang chờ!\n Mua để nhận</div><img src=\'resource/vật phẩm/3.png\' scale=0.3 /><div fontcolor=#ffd987 outline=2,#000000> 128</div><div fontcolor=#fffbf0 outline=2,#000000> cùng với EXP VIP</div>',
['语言_mon_fu_01_d_2']='<div fontcolor=#fffbf0 outline=2,#000000>Tổng giá trị</div><img src=\'resource/vật phẩm/3.png\' scale=0.3 /><div fontcolor=#ffd987 outline=2,#000000> 9200 KNB</div><div fontcolor=#fffbf0 outline=2,#000000> Phần thưởng Sang trọng đang chờ!\n Mua để nhận</div><img src=\'resource/vật phẩm/3.png\' scale=0.3 /><div fontcolor=#ffd987 outline=2,#000000> 328</div><div fontcolor=#fffbf0 outline=2,#000000> cùng với EXP VIP</div>',
['语言_subt_02_1']=': D',
['语言_subt_02_2']='Chúc may mắn!',
['语言_subt_02_3']='GOGOGO!',
['语言_subt_02_4']='Đặt cược vào các trận đấu để kiếm Điểm Giải vô địch và đổi lấy các vật phẩm khác nhau!',
['语言_subt_02_5']='Đặt cược vào các trận đấu để kiếm Xu Vô Địch và đổi lấy các vật phẩm khác nhau!',
['语言_subt_02_6']='Chính thức bắt đầu lúc 20:30! ',
['语言_subt_02_7']='Đây có phải là một cuộc chiến tranh thế giới? Tại sao chúng tôi nhận được rất nhiều giao dịch lớn ở đây…',
['语言_subt_02_8']='2-ra-3 là gì? Chà, bạn sử dụng đội 1 của mình để đấu với đội 1 đối lập, trong khi đội 2 đấu với đội 2',
['语言_subt_02_9']='Gee, phần thưởng cửa hàng tuyệt vời!',
['语言_subt_02_10']='Nào, chúng ta cần thêm chip!',
['语言_subt_02_11']='Chỉ 1 trận đấu mỗi ngày, hãy từ từ',
