['语言_hol_ni_06_01']='You can\'t challenge Matatabi when it\'s having a rest. The only way is to collect enough Medals to be qualified.',
['语言_hol_ni_06_02']='To the right so you can find Matatabi. Don\'t forget to collect flags to trade for rewards.',
['语言_hol_ni_06_04']='To the left so you can find Shukaku. Don\'t forget to set off the Fireworks to cheer ninjas up.',
['语言_hol_ni_06_03']='Shukaku can be challenged at any time, but there is a number limit. Challenge chances reset upon each refresh.',
['语言_hol_ni_06_05']='Interesting, we have 2 tailed beasts out there.',
['语言_hol_ni_06_06']='Then it\'s just the time to show Sasuke and Naruto my training results!',
['语言_hol_ni_09_01']='Oh man, Shukaku and Matatabi coming to train my students? I\'m in love with this Sports already!',
['语言_hol_ni_09_02']='I\'m very confident with you guys, this is a great opportunity to strengthen yourselves! Enjoy your youth!',
['语言_hol_ni_09_03']='You need to collect enough Medals to start a challenge! To a certain progress, I\'ll reward you my precious red packet!',
['语言_hol_ni_09_04']='And yes, when they\'re able to be challenged, you\'ll get rewards by attacking them.',
['语言_hol_ni_10_01']='Notice',
['语言_hol_ni_10_02']='NARUTO SPORTS IS OFFICIALLY ON!',
['语言_hol_ni_10_03']='Your attention please, this Sports is SUPER DIFFICULT!\nWe would like to thank Land of Lightning and Land of Wind for sending Matatabi and Shukaku, 2 powerful beasts to examine!\nOnly can players who collect enough Medals challenge them!\nYour good performance is to be recorded and spread throughout the countries. Ninjas, show yourselves!',
['语言_hol_op_lo_01_1']='1. During the event, players can get item <div fontcolor=#c23f35>[Felicity Prism]</div> by purchasing Time Gift Grande. Felicity Prisms are required to play Lucky Flop, 100 prisms to play it 1 time.\n2. In each turn of event, players can select 1 prize and add it to the prize pool. Before getting the prize added to prize pool, it can be changed optionally.\n3. Within a turn, players have chance to win the Ultimate Prize only after doing 20 times of Lucky Flop. <div fontcolor=#c23f35>The chance to get Ultimate Prize increases </div>for flops after the 20 times, and Ultimate Prize is guaranteed to be obtained for the 35 flops! \n4. During the event, players can <div fontcolor=#c23f35>use Golds to buy [Felicity Prism] at a 60% discount for 5 times</div> and purchase at original price for 5 times.\n5. After obtaining the Ultimate Prize, or all prizes of current turn have been obtained, players can start another turn.\n6. Felicity Prisms are <div fontcolor=#c23f35>converted to Silvers in the proportion of 1:2000</div>, please use them in time',																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																														  
