['语言_ski_pa3_01_673']='Deals 125% A.DMG to all foes in the first and middle rows. 30% DMG up against Tank foes. 60% chance to inflict [Armor Break] on targets, lasts for 2 turns',
['语言_ski_pa3_01_674']='Attacks a Support foe preferentially, dealing 300% A.DMG in total. This skill ignores target\'s DEF by 60%. Also, inflicts [Armor Break] on targets, lasts for 2 turns. If this skill kills a target, then cast this skill again',
