['语言_ski_pa3_01_688']='Deals 120% T.DMG to all foes, 30% chance to inflict [On Fire] on them, lasts for 2 turns. Boosts [On Fire] rate to 60% against Melee foes',
['语言_ski_pa3_01_689']='Deals 148% T.DMG to 3 random foes, 20% chance to inflict [Stun] on them. Definitely [Stun] foes under [On Fire]',
