['语言_ski_pa3_01_691']='Receives 35% more A.DMG; receives 35% less T.DMG',
['语言_ski_pa3_01_692']='When battle starts, immunes to [Seal] and all debuff effects (CC, debuffs, DOT)',
['语言_ski_pa3_01_693']='Deals 125% T.DMG to all foes in the first and middle rows, 25% chance to inflict [SPD↓], lasts for 2 turns. Also, the Boss gains [Over Turn Healing], heals itself with HP equals to 50% of Three-Tails\' ATK each turn, lasts for 2 turns',
['语言_ski_pa3_01_694']='Attacks a Ranged foe preferentially, dealing 350% T.DMG in total, 40% chance to inflict [Cannot Revive] on it. Also, the Boss gains [DEF↑] which boosts its DEF by 20%, lasts for 2 turns',
